  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Biochemical Oxygen Demand&nbsp;(BOD)&nbsp;is&nbsp;also called Biological Oxygen Demand.</p><p>It is the amount of dissolved oxygen&nbsp;needed (i.e. demanded) by aerobic&nbsp;biological organisms to break down organic material present in a given water sample at certain temperature over a specific time period</p>",
